WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.940
The checklist turns the nine stages
into something you can tick off,

2
00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:05.537
and that's its whole purpose.

3
00:00:05.537 --> 00:00:08.194
There's one row per stage, plus PIV,

4
00:00:08.194 --> 00:00:12.425
and one each for the Intune,
Arc and non-person tracks.

5
00:00:12.425 --> 00:00:14.000
A few are easy to miss.

6
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.712
Export site links, not just O U links.

7
00:00:16.712 --> 00:00:19.262
Match accounts before the first full sync.

8
00:00:19.262 --> 00:00:23.200
Write every access rule on
codes, and don't use member-of.

9
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:26.312
Decide unit restriction
before the unit exists.

10
00:00:26.312 --> 00:00:28.350
Pair every grant with a block.

11
00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:32.600
Prove seven days of sole-source
changes before closing the ticket path.

12
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.650
And route logs out from the first day.

13
00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:36.430
Finally, who decides.
